## 4. ROUTES & NAVIGATION

### Root Dashboard (+page.svelte)
Displays task counts by status with clickable cards that filter to `/tasks?status=X`

### Tasks (/tasks/+page.svelte)
- Inline detail panel (fixed right sidebar overlay, not a Sheet)
- Responsive table with status, priority, spec ref, notes count, tags
- WebSocket subscriptions to `tasks` topic for live updates
- Animated highlight on task update (3s)
- URL params for filtering: `?status=`, `?type=`, `?tag=`, `?assignee=`, `?automation=`, `?ref=`
- Disables SSR (`export const ssr = false`)

### Items (/items/+page.svelte)
- Hierarchical tree view of spec items
- Click to view detail in sheet panel
- Supports deep linking with `?ref=` param
- Disables SSR (`export const ssr = false`)

### Inbox, Observations, Triage
- Placeholder pages exist but not detailed in files read

